ll stuck?\",\"chatLive\":\"Start live chat\",\"allFaqs\":\"All FAQs →\",\"questions\":{\"customs\":{\"q\":\"{customs, select, atDelivery {How are customs handled when my order arrives?} other {What if customs charges show up at my door?}}\",\"a\":\"{customs, select, atDelivery {The price you see covers the product and shipping. Duty, tax, and any customs are collected by the courier when your order is delivered — based on {country} customs rates, no markup from us. We'll share the expected amount before you pay; the final figure can vary slightly.} other {They won't. Every price you see is the landed price — customs, duties, and import taxes already paid by us before checkout. The number on the product page is the number you pay.}}\",\"tag\":\"Customs \u0026 duty\"},\"priceShifts\":{\"q\":\"Do prices change while I'm shopping?\",\"a\":\"Cross-border prices do move — source price, FX, and customs all shift. The moment you add an item to your cart, that price is locked for 30 minutes.\",\"tag\":\"Pricing\"},\"authentic\":{\"q\":\"How do I know it's not a fake?\",\"a\":\"Every seller on Desertcart is verified, and our authentication team spot-checks high-risk SKUs. If something arrives that isn't authentic, you get a full refund and we eat the return cost.\",\"tag\":\"Authenticity\"},\"delivery\":{\"q\":\"When will it actually arrive?\",\"a\":\"Standard delivery to {country} takes 3–7 days from order to door. Most products ship within 24 hours of payment.\",\"tag\":\"Delivery\"},\"returns\":{\"q\":\"Can I return something I imported?\",\"a\":\"Yes — {days}-day returns at our cost on most items shipped to {countryCode}. You don't pay the return shipping back to origin.\",\"tag\":\"Returns\"},\"payment\":{\"q\":\"How do I pay? Can I pay in local currency?\",\"a\":\"Pay in your local currency with cards, Apple/Google Pay, or wallets. Every price on site is already in your currency — no conversion math at checkout.\",\"tag\":\"Payment\"},\"support\":{\"q\":\"What if I need