 for Winter Fall, Soft Fuzzy Plush Throw Gifts\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Bedsure\"},\"description\":\"Buy Bedsure GentleSoft Sherpa Fleece Throw Blanket for Couch, Non-Heated, Thick \u0026 Warm Cozy Comfort Blanket for Winter Fall, Soft Fuzzy Plush Throw Gifts for Women and Men, Grey, 50x60 Inches: Throws - desertcart.com ✓ FREE DELIVERY possible on eligible purchases\",\"image\":[\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h2n60bxLL.jpg\"],\"color\":\"Dark Grey\",\"size\":\"Throw (50\\\" x 60\\\")\",\"material\":\"Polyester\",\"hasFeature\":[{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Additional Features\",\"value\":\"Cozy, Soft, Warm\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Age Range Description\",\"value\":\"Adult\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Best Sellers Rank\",\"value\":\"#721 in Home \u0026 Kitchen ( See Top 100 in Home \u0026 Kitchen ) #5 in Bed Throws\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Blanket Form\",\"value\":\"Throw Blanket\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"01 - Grey\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Customer Reviews\",\"value\":\"4.7 out of 5 stars 97,619 Reviews\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Fabric Type\",\"value\":\"100% Polyester\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Fabric Warmth Description\",\"value\":\"Heavyweight\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Fill Material\",\"value\":\"Polyester\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Included Components\",\"value\":\"1 blanket (50\\\" x 60\\\")\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Item Dimensions L x W\",\"value\":\"10.24\\\"L x 6.3\\\"W\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Item Type Name\",\"value\":\"throw-blankets\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Item Weight\",\"value\":\"2 pounds\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Material\",\"value\":\"Polyester\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Material Type\",\"value\":\"Polyester\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Model 