r long-lasting plushness.\",\"Versatile Style Essential\":\"Ideal for couch, travel, pets, or gifting—fits seamlessly into your modern lifestyle.\"},\"emojis list\":{\"🧵\":\"260 GSM Sherpa plush backing\",\"🌡️\":\"Thick \u0026 warm heavyweight fleece\",\"🛋️\":\"50x60 inch versatile throw size\"},\"factual summary\":\"The Bedsure GentleSoft Sherpa Fleece Throw Blanket is a premium 50x60 inch heavyweight polyester throw featuring a reversible design with 220 GSM velvety flannel on one side and 260 GSM plush Sherpa on the other. This non-heated blanket offers natural warmth and softness, enhanced durability with fade and shed resistance, and versatile use for home, travel, pets, or gifting. Recognized by Good Housekeeping, it’s a top-rated cozy essential for millennial professionals seeking comfort and style.\"},\"features_list\":[\"100% Polyester\",\"Kindly Note: This blanket is designed to provide cozy comfort in its natural form, without any electric heating function. Perfect for those who appreciate the simple warmth and softness of a traditional blanket.\",\"Reversible Softness: Titled the Good Housekeeping Best Bedding Awards Winner as a Fuzzy Fleece Throw, this blanket is designed with 220 GSM velvety flannel on the top and 260 GSM extremely soft Sherpa on the back, this double-sided cozy blanket offers the utmost comfort all year round.\",\"Thick \u0026 Warm: The Bedsure Sherpa Fleece Blanket maintains the ideal balance between weight and warmth. No wires, no electricity. Enjoy being cuddled up by this soft and calming blanket whenever you're ready to snuggle up.\",\"Versatile: This throw blanket (50\\\" x 60\\\") is the perfect accessory for your family and pets to get cozy—whether used as an addition to your kid's room, as a home decor element that coordinates with your couch, or as the designated cozy blanket bed for your pet.\",\"Giftable: Available in multiple sizes and colors, this Sherpa blanket also comes in a festive gift-ready package, making this ultra-soft blanket perfect for your loved ones or as a surgery recovery gift.\",\"Enhanced Durability: Made with unmatched quality, this soft blanket features neat stitching that ensures a more robust connection at the seams for improved durability. Guaranteed to resist fading and shedding.\"],\"image_urls\":[\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h2n60bxLL.jpg\"],\"main_image_url\":\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h2n60bxLL.jpg\",\"top_level?\":false,\"hierarchical_paths\":[],\"labels\":\"$undefined\",\"seo_keyword_list\":[],\"delivery_ranges\":[],\"badges\":\"$undefined\",\"condition\":\"$undefined\",\"blacklisted\":false,\"restriction_details\":{\"restricted\":false,\"restriction_type\":null,\"user_message\":null},\"price\":{\"currency_code\":\"INR\",\"formatted\":\"₹ 5355\",\"value\":535500,\"plain\":5355},\"scout_price\":{\"currency_code\":\"INR\",\"formatted\":\"₹ 1,820\",\"value\":182000,\"plain\":1820,\"value_usd_cents\":0},\"seller_info\":null,\"qna\":[{\"answer\":\"I have this blanket since Christmas 2020, I do experience static all the time. It has been washed and dried too. It doesn't bother me or my dog. We love this blanket immensely! I wanna replace all my blankets with these.\\n💗💗💗\\nBest gift ever! 10000%\",\"question\":\"does it cause static?\"},{\"answer\":\"I washed mine in top load with agitator on the towel setting and dried it on heavy and it is just like before.  Supper soft and warm.\",\"question\":\"Can I wash it in non-frontload washing machines? Meaning top load washing machine with agitator...\"},{\"answer\":\"It is off white\",\"question\":\"Is the other side white or off white\"},{\"answer\":\"Hi, Winery, this sherpa blanket is made in China. Thanks!\",\"question\":\"Is this made in china , i have always been disappointed in anything i bought from china ?\"}],\"tech_specs\":[{\"key\":\"ASIN\",\"value\":\"B0158EQJSY\"},{\"key\":\"Additional Features\",\"value\":\"Cozy, Soft, Warm\"},{\"key\":\"Age Range Description\",\"value\":\"Ad