;color:#ffffff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase"><span translate="no" data-sentry-element="Tag" data-sentry-component="NoTranslate" data-sentry-source-file="NoTranslate.tsx">Pro</span></span><span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;line-height:18px"><span translate="no" data-sentry-element="Tag" data-sentry-component="NoTranslate" data-sentry-source-file="NoTranslate.tsx">Desertcart PRO</span></span></div><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#475569;margin:0 0 10px 0">Fast, free shipping, member pricing &amp; priority support.</p><a style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none" href="/en/pro">Join PRO →</a></div></div></div></div><script>$RS("S:6","P:6")</script><div hidden id="S:7"><div class="ProductPage_mobileProductDetails__EzS1D"><div class="ProductDetails_details__9JxuF" data-sentry-component="ProductDetails" data-sentry-source-file="ProductDetails.jsx"><h3>Details</h3><ul><li><span>Brand</span><div class="ProductDetails_separator__poIsx"></div><span>Bedsure</span></li><li><span>Color</span><div class="ProductDetails_separator__poIsx"></div><span>01 - Grey</span></li><li><span>Material</span><div class="ProductDetails_separator__poIsx"></div><span>Polyester</span></li></ul><button class="ProductDetails_seeMore___kRrK">See more</button></div></div></div><script>$RS("S:7","P:7")</script><div hidden id="S:8"></div><script>$RS("S:8","P:8")</script><div hidden id="S:9"><div class="ProductPage_description__qKkXI"><div aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="product-description" data-sentry-component="ProductDescription" data-sentry-source-file="ProductDescription.tsx"><h3 class="ProductDescription_heading___C3yJ">Description</h3><p class="ProductDescription_tagline__U4PYE">🛋️ Wrap yourself in warmth, style, and that coveted cozy vibe everyone’s talking about!</p><div class="ProductDescription_productFeatures__8UhdC" data-sentry-component="ProductFeatures" data-sentry-source-file="ProductFeatures.tsx"><ul class="ProductDescription_productFeatureList__FFH8R" data-sentry-component="ProductFeaturesList" data-sentry-source-file="ProductFeatures.tsx"><li class="ProductDescription_productFeatureItem__RxgCK">DOUBLE SIDED LUXURY - Reversible 220 GSM velvety flannel and ultra-soft 260 GSM Sherpa for year-round comfort.</li><li class="ProductDescription_productFeatureItem__RxgCK">PERFECT COZY WEIGHT - Heavyweight warmth without wires or electricity—pure natural snugness anytime.</li><li class="ProductDescription_productFeatureItem__RxgCK">AWARD WINNING SOFTNESS - Good Housekeeping Best Bedding Award winner—join thousands who swear by its fuzzy comfort.</li><li class="ProductDescription_productFeatureItem__RxgCK">DURABILITY MEETS DESIGN - Expert stitching ensures fade and shed resistance for long-lasting plushness.</li><li class="ProductDescription_productFeatureItem__RxgCK">VERSATILE STYLE ESSENTIAL - Ideal for couch, travel, pets, or gifting—fits seamlessly into your modern lifestyle.</li></ul></div><p class="ProductDescription_description___fjoh">The Bedsure GentleSoft Sherpa Fleece Throw Blanket is a premium 50x60 inch heavyweight polyester throw featuring a reversible design with 220 GSM velvety flannel on one side and 260 GSM plush Sherpa on the other. This non-heated blanket offers natural warmth and softness, enhanced durability with fade and shed resistance, and versatile use for home, travel, pets, or gifting. Recognized by Good Housekeeping, it’s a top-rated cozy essential for millennial professionals seeking comfort and style.</p><div class="ProductDescription_addonImages__Aa_H0" data-sentry-component="AplusImageGallery" data-sentry-source-file="AplusImageGallery.tsx"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/50eb891b-0ec7-422e-b3cc-4a92d7acb464.__CR0,0,2928,1250_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImg__IrIQ2" alt="Large manufacture image 1"/><div class="ProductDescription_addonImagesRow__xtO4L"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410xIfBfCGL.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 1"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415eXyJGR5L.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 2"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DEFgq3ARL.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 3"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41enG52T78L.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 4"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nscM4V65L.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 5"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41uDjF4z0TL.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 6"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JDm78wX4L.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 7"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bdclCet8L.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 8"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oY8buBlKL.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 9"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zKbfTZ0aL.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 10"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wuruoYcxL.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDescription_addonImgSmall__DvyaO" alt="Small manufacture image 11"/><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/054a1019-1633-42af-8d6f-ed4349c94623.__AC_SR166,182___.jpg" class="ProductDes